flowchart RL
    N0[Store]
    N1((Validate))
    N2(Load parse)
    N3(Check store)
    N4[Load notify]
    N5{Load}
    N6([Fetch validate])
    N7[Notify store]
    N0 --> N1
    N1 -->|ok| N2
    N1 --> N3
    N3 --> N4
